angle_coeff 10 backmap/harmonic at 70.000077 109.1180
angle_coeff 11 backmap/harmonic at 100.000110 110.0920
angle_coeff 12 backmap/harmonic at 70.000077 109.1220
angle_coeff 13 backmap/harmonic at 70.000077 109.0740
angle_coeff 14 backmap/harmonic at 110.000121 106.6330
angle_coeff 15 backmap/harmonic at 47.801200 121.3790
angle_coeff 16 backmap/harmonic at 126.000139 120.1030
