angle_coeff 34 backmap/table cg table_a2.table ENTRY
angle_coeff 35 backmap/table cg table_a3.table ENTRY
angle_coeff 36 backmap/table cg table_a0.table ENTRY
angle_coeff 37 backmap/harmonic at 140.000155 112.7040
